{{!
    @template mod_presenterai/grade

    The grading screen for one attempt: who and which attempt, when it was
    recorded, its length and status, the recording, the transcript, the
    visual evidence note for staff who may read it, a live total and the
    scoring form.

    The player region is empty at load. mod_presenterai/grading opens the
    shared player into it, reading the recording id and the player's
    accessible name from the root's data attributes. Its polite live region
    exists at page load so the loading message is spoken. The total region is
    also polite, so a grader using a screen reader hears the total change as
    they score; it's a preview, and the server computes the stored total.

    The visual evidence section renders only when showvisual is true. Its
    note is escaped text, labeled staff only.

    Rescore is a POST form carrying the sesskey, shown only when canrescore
    is true. When rescorenomedia is true a sentence says why there's no
    button instead.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * rootid - The root element id, given to mod_presenterai/grading.
    * cmid - The course module id.
    * recordingid - The recording id.
    * learnername - The learner's full name.
    * attemptlabel - For example "Attempt 2".
    * recorded - When the attempt was recorded.
    * length - Its length, m:ss.
    * status - Its status label.
    * mediaavailable - Whether the recording's media still exists.
    * watcharia - The accessible name of the player.
    * hastranscript - Whether there is a transcript.
    * transcript - The transcript, escaped, with line breaks as HTML.
    * transcriptempty - The placeholder when there is no transcript.
    * showvisual - Whether the viewer may read the visual evidence note.
    * hasvisual - Whether there is a note.
    * visualevidence - The note, escaped, with line breaks as HTML.
    * visualempty - The placeholder when there is no note.
    * canrescore - Whether to offer "Rescore with AI".
    * rescorenomedia - Whether to say the attempt can't be rescored because nothing is left to score from.
    * rescoreurl - grade.php, the rescore form's action.
    * sesskey - The session key for the rescore form.
    * form - The rendered scoring form, HTML.
    * reporturl - The submissions report URL.
    * total - {label}: the total before any score is chosen.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "rootid": "mod-presenterai-grade",
        "cmid": 12,
        "recordingid": 8,
        "learnername": "Ada Lovelace",
        "attemptlabel": "Attempt 2",
        "recorded": "6/10/26, 14:00",
        "length": "6:12",
        "status": "Submitted",
        "mediaavailable": true,
        "watcharia": "Recording by Ada Lovelace, made on 6/10/26, 14:00",
        "hastranscript": true,
        "transcript": "Good afternoon.<br>Today I will argue for wind power.",
        "transcriptempty": "There is no transcript for this attempt.",
        "showvisual": true,
        "hasvisual": false,
        "visualevidence": "",
        "visualempty": "There is no visual evidence note for this attempt.",
        "canrescore": true,
        "rescorenomedia": false,
        "rescoreurl": "https://example.com/mod/presenterai/grade.php",
        "sesskey": "abc123",
        "form": "<form action=\"#\" method=\"post\"><p>The scoring form.</p></form>",
        "reporturl": "https://example.com/mod/presenterai/report.php?id=12",
        "total": {"label": "Total: no scores chosen yet"}
    }
}}
<div id="{{rootid}}" class="mod-presenterai-grade" data-recordingid="{{recordingid}}" data-cmid="{{cmid}}" data-watcharia="{{watcharia}}">
    <h2 class="mod-presenterai-grade-heading">{{learnername}}: {{attemptlabel}}</h2>
    <dl class="mod-presenterai-grade-meta row">
        <dt class="col-sm-3">{{#str}}col_recorded, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">{{recorded}}</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3">{{#str}}col_length, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">{{length}}</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3">{{#str}}col_status, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">{{status}}</dd>
    </dl>
    <div class="mod-presenterai-grade-columns">
        <div class="mod-presenterai-grade-evidence">
            <div class="mod-presenterai-player" data-region="player" tabindex="-1"></div>
            <div class="accesshide" aria-live="polite" data-region="live"></div>
            <section class="mod-presenterai-grade-transcript mt-3">
                <h3>{{#str}}grade_transcript, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</h3>
                {{#hastranscript}}
                <div class="mod-presenterai-transcript-text">{{{transcript}}}</div>
                {{/hastranscript}}
                {{^hastranscript}}
                <p class="mod-presenterai-placeholder">{{transcriptempty}}</p>
                {{/hastranscript}}
            </section>
            {{#showvisual}}
            <section class="mod-presenterai-grade-visual mt-3">
                <h3>{{#str}}grade_visualevidence, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</h3>
                <p class="small">{{#str}}grade_staffonly, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</p>
                {{#hasvisual}}
                <div class="mod-presenterai-visual-text">{{{visualevidence}}}</div>
                {{/hasvisual}}
                {{^hasvisual}}
                <p class="mod-presenterai-placeholder">{{visualempty}}</p>
                {{/hasvisual}}
            </section>
            {{/showvisual}}
        </div>
        <div class="mod-presenterai-grade-scoring">
            {{#canrescore}}
            <form class="mod-presenterai-grade-rescore mb-3" action="{{rescoreurl}}" method="post">
                <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{cmid}}">
                <input type="hidden" name="recordingid" value="{{recordingid}}">
                <input type="hidden" name="action" value="rescore">
                <input type="hidden" name="sesskey" value="{{sesskey}}">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-secondary">{{#str}}rescore, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</button>
                <p class="small mt-1 mb-0">{{#str}}rescore_help, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</p>
            </form>
            {{/canrescore}}
            {{#rescorenomedia}}
            <p class="mod-presenterai-grade-rescore-note">{{#str}}rescore_unavailable_nomedia, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</p>
            {{/rescorenomedia}}
            {{#total}}
            <div class="mod-presenterai-grade-total alert alert-secondary" data-region="total" aria-live="polite">{{label}}</div>
            {{/total}}
            {{{form}}}
        </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3"><a href="{{reporturl}}">{{#str}}viewsubmissions, mod_presenterai{{/str}}</a></p>
</div>
